      "value": "Based on my analysis of the constraints and hypothesis, I need to implement a computational workflow using the Shrinking Core Model (SCM) for MgH2 hydrogen absorption. Since no experimental data is available and we only have numpy/scipy/pandas available, I'll implement a physically-grounded SCM simulation with explicit kinetic parameters from literature ranges, perform 50+ cycles, and include independent validation through resolution comparison.\n\nLet me first check the design document referenced in the context, then implement the full workflow."
